4e:["$","p","b11",{"className":"mt-[1.1em] first:mt-0","children":["Pick a few signs that tell you the new site works: more enquiries from the contact form, more demo requests, fewer support emails, faster pages. Note where each one stands today, so there is something to compare against after launch."]}]
